## What {{ project }} does

| Pillar | Capabilities |
| --- | --- |
| **Adaptive 3-Tab Shell, Universal Search & Settings Hub** | 3 living workspaces (**Discussions** with inline **All · Pinned · Shared** filters, **Notes & tasks** with live Notes/Reminders/Inbox segments, and **Apps** for Voice, Custom Screens, and Templates) plus persistent top-bar **Universal Search** and **Settings Hub** (including **Theme, palette, and layout**). Adapts automatically between an IME-aware phone bottom bar and a **92 dp** tablet navigation rail with a collapsible dual-pane sidebar (`232–360 dp`), preserving drafts across rotation and split-screen. |
| **Universal Search, Command Palette (`Ctrl+K`) & Everyday Workflows** | Search chats, notes, shared items, settings, and tools from every screen with 0 ms local matches plus debounced server FTS5 search, or open the hardware-keyboard **Command Palette** (`Ctrl+K` / `Cmd+K`). Includes {{ curated_workflows_count }} curated everyday workflows plus encrypted per-profile custom templates that strictly stage editable drafts before sending. |
| **Concurrent Multi-Run & Multi-User Isolation** | Run multiple concurrent tasks across different discussions simultaneously for one user without canceling active streams or mixing deltas/approvals, while serving many concurrent users on **one single HTTPS hostname** (`/p/<profile>`) with isolated homes, workspaces, and 256-bit keys. [Multi-Profile Deploy](docs/accounts.md) |
| **Instant Infinite Chats & Runtime Performance** | Instant session switching with smooth lazy history paging, frame-budgeted live stream coalescing (0 ms first-token latency), zero-allocation custom views, bounded bitmap/token caches cleared under memory pressure and lock, and a shrunk **{{ release_apk_size_en }}** signed release APK (**-19%** footprint). |
| **Live Connection Doctor** | Built-in parallel diagnostics under **Settings → Connection doctor** verifying server reachability & latency, companion fork capabilities (`{{ expected_fork_capabilities }}/{{ expected_fork_capabilities }}` with clear upstream non-fork warning), push readiness, app updates, ambient permissions, and language sync—with 1-tap fixes and a strictly redacted safe report copy. |
| **Coding, Visual Diffs & Duplex Voice** | Streaming replies with rich Markdown, syntax-highlighted `CodeReader`, visual hunk-level approval diffs, hands-free **Duplex Voice** plus offline/system dictation and offline speech playback. |
| **Live UI Modding, Appearance Studio & On-the-Fly Widgets** | Tune theme mode, curated/custom accents (WCAG-AA `4.5:1` Day/Night invariant), density, text size, startup tab, and shortcuts in **Settings → Theme, palette, and layout**, or ask Hermes to adapt a screen or build an interactive tool (`ui.patch` + Surfaces v2) with preview, atomic apply, full rollback history, and profile-scoped Home Screen Widgets. [Live UI & Widgets](docs/live-ui-and-widgets.md) |
| **Hardened Profile Vault & Permissions Center** | Per-profile AES-GCM encrypted storage with multi-mode lock (**Biometric / phone lock**, **6–12 digit PIN**, or **12+ character passphrase**), smart **5-minute** default auto-lock grace (configurable), persisted backoff, atomic profile wipe, **Settings → App permissions** center (1-tap **Allow** / **Open Android settings**), Android 16 Live Updates notifications showing active concurrent task counts, Quick Settings Tile, and App Shortcuts. |
| **Knowledge, Inline Sharing & Power Tools** | Capture Smart Notes (with inline **My notes · Shared with me** filters) in **Notes & tasks**, filter shared discussions directly inside **Discussions**, manage Hermes’s Memory (`MEMORY.md` / `USER.md`), Skills, and Workspace Files & Git diffs inside **Settings**, review pattern-gated habit suggestions (`>= 3` occurrences), pin/fork/export threads, and share **7 resource kinds** (`note`, `skill`, `surface`, `widget`, `tool`, `artifact`, `session`) across users on the same server. [Notes, Search & Universal Sharing](docs/brain-and-sharing.md) |
| **Zero-Root Ambient Intelligence** | Strictly opt-in per profile (all OFF by default). Searchable per-app notification allowlist guarded by a fail-closed privacy filter that hard-blocks OTP/2FA codes, password managers, banking apps, and secret lockscreen notices. 1-tap **Summarize**, **Create note**, **Add to calendar**, and reviewed **Reply**, plus Now Playing media controls. [Ambient Intelligence](docs/ambient.md) |
| **Universal Push & Closed-App Delivery** | Zero-leak notifications via Firebase Cloud Messaging or self-hosted UnifiedPush (ntfy + Web Push encryption). Carries opaque routing metadata only—titles and bodies stay on your gateway until you unlock the owning profile. Supports urgency tiers (`normal`, `high`, `silent`) and Quiet hours. [Push & Reminders](docs/push.md) |
| **Universal Capture & 11 OS Actions** | Share text, photos (EXIF/GPS/ICC stripped into fresh sRGB pixels), documents, or camera captures into any thread. Review and launch 11 native Android actions: calendar, share sheet, map search, turn-by-turn navigation, alarm, timer, dialer, SMS, email, contact editor, and sensitive clipboard copy. [Android Actions](docs/android-actions.md) |

## Quickstart

### 1. Get the signed APK and stay up to date

- **Official signed releases (recommended):** Download `{{ release_apk }}`, `{{ checksum_file }}`, and `release.json` from [Latest GitHub Release](https://github.com/{{ repository }}/releases/latest), then verify checksum, APK signature, and GitHub build provenance. [Releases and in-app auto-update](docs/release.md) · [Verify a release](docs/delivery.md#verify-a-release)
- **Built-in verified in-app updates:** Open **Settings → App updates** to check GitHub Releases directly from your phone. Downloads are fail-closed: the app verifies HTTPS GitHub release hosts, constant-time `SHA256SUMS` match, and matching APK signing certificate before handing off to Android’s native installer.
- **Development builds:** Open a passing [Workspace checks](https://github.com/{{ repository }}/actions/workflows/checks.yml) run and download the **android-debug** artifact (includes `app-debug.apk` and `SHA256SUMS`).

### 2. Connect a profile on one HTTPS host

1. Deploy our Hermes agent fork ([{{ fork_repository }}]({{ fork_url }})) behind **one single HTTPS hostname** (`https://hermes.example.com`), routing each user to `/p/<profile>` with an isolated home and access key. [Deploy multi-profile accounts](docs/accounts.md)
2. Open **Connect Hermes**, enter a profile label, your shared HTTPS server address, your **Server profile** slug (the app composes `/p/<profile>` automatically), and your access key.
3. Protect the local device vault with your preferred lock mode (**Biometric / phone lock**, **6–12 digit PIN**, or **12+ character passphrase**) and adjust auto-lock grace (`5 min` default) or optional permissions anytime in **Settings → App lock and auto-lock timeout** and **Settings → App permissions**.

## Build and verify locally

Requires **JDK 21**, **Android SDK** (`compileSdk` and `buildToolsVersion` in `gradle.properties`), and **Python 3.11+** (with `uv` or `pip`).

```sh
# 1. Fast host verification (docs check, CI scripts, server, deploy & verification suites in parallel)
{{ fast_check }}

# 2. Build, lint, and run Android JVM unit tests
./gradlew :app:lintDebug :app:testDebugUnitTest :app:assembleDebug :app:assembleRelease

# 3. Install on a connected device or emulator
adb install -r {{ debug_apk }}
```

Run `./gradlew :app:connectedDebugAndroidTest` against a connected Android emulator or handset to execute the full instrumentation suite.

